A||||4||Frank Sombers||Door bushing replacement||||5||
Z||000000||Frank Sombers||03-31-2001||01:30 AM||||Do you need to remove the door to replace the<BR>lower door hinge bushings? Is there a technique that I don't know about? After<BR>reading all of the technical questions and<BR>discussions pertaining to this topic (and<BR>reading Theogre's cave section on doors), I started to replace the bushings and pins. After replacing the top, I drove the lower pin out but was unable to get enough door<BR>movement to be able to clear & remove the lower bushings. Is there a way to get these out without removing the door? I was working<BR>by myself and had the door supported by my<BR>floor jack. It seems that all of the prior discussions talk about the upper set but none address the lower. Thank you for any help you can provide, it will be greatly appreciated.<BR>Frank<BR>ps. Theogre, I followed your advice and put<BR>a nylon washer in the lower hinge. Even with<BR>out replacing the lower bushings it seems to have made a world of difference. <BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Coop88||03-31-2001||01:59 AM||||I just did my driver's door. After I popped the pins out, I just pulled the door away from the car. This gave me just enough space to get the old bushings out, and the new ones in. I don't know of any way to do one hinge at a time. It really helps if you have an assistant and a jack hold the door. I also did the nylon washer thing, only I went ahead and put one on both hinges. It works.||||reg||10
Z||000002||theogre||03-31-2001||12:27 PM||||You have to get both pins out, replace the bushings, then put the pins back. You can stuff the washer in the bottom hinge after the top pin is installed. <P>works best with helper, 2 if they are small. bloody door is heavy. Even with help blocking up the door is a good idea. I use a floor jack with a wood block on it. Don't use small jacks. they tip over too easy.||||reg||1
Z||000003||DandRauto||04-02-2001||09:55 AM||||Got the bushing and Pins.  Will be doing this shortly.  Where is the info about the nylon washers?<P>thanks||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||04-02-2001||07:16 PM||||in my cave. link at bottom of page.||||reg||1
